==Battleground==
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~8.33 seconds<sup>100f~250f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lancer (Enemy)|Lancer]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

